        {
          "type": "text",
          "html": "The memories can be done in any order. For a complete guide of locations, along with maps and methods to get to each of the memories, see the <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Mahjarrat_Memories_(miniquest)#Memories_of_the_Mahjarrat\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">in-depth guide</a>."
        },
        {
          "type": "table",
          "label": "Memory · Location",
          "head": [
            "Memory",
            "Location"
          ],
          "rows": [
            [
              "<a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Wahisietel\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Wahisietel</a>",
              "Go to <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Nardah\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Nardah</a>. Go to the Ali the Wise&#39;s house, the northern-most one from the <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Elidinis_Statuette\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Elidinis Statuette</a>, and use the charged engrammeter there."
            ],
            [
              "<a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Azzanadra\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Azzanadra</a>",
              "Go to the <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Jaldraocht_Pyramid\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Jaldraocht Pyramid</a>. Use the engrammeter in the altar room."
            ],
            [
              "<a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Enakhra\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Enakhra</a>",
              "Travel to <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Enakhra%27s_Temple\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Enakhra&#39;s Temple</a>. Use the engrammeter in the central room."
            ],
            [
              "<a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Akthanakos\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Akthanakos</a>",
              "Travel to <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Enakhra%27s_Temple\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Enakhra&#39;s Temple</a>. Use the ladder in the central room, go through the magic barrier and up the ladder. Use the engrammeter in the first chamber."
            ],
            [
              "<a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Bilrach\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Bilrach</a>",
              "Go to <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Daemonheim\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Daemonheim</a>. Use the engrammeter next to the banker."
            ],
            [
              "<a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Hazeel\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Hazeel</a>",
              "Go south of <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Ardougne_Zoo\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Ardougne Zoo</a>. Enter the <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Cave_entrance_(Southern_Ardougne_sewer)\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">cave entrance</a> east of the <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Clock_Tower_(building)\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Clock Tower</a>. Take the raft, and enter the <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Hazeel_Cultist\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Hazeel Cultist</a> headquarters. Use the engrammeter. See <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Hazeel_Cult/Quick_guide\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Hazeel Cult</a> quest guide if you failed to do so."
            ],
            [
              "<a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Lucien\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Lucien</a>",
              "Go to Lucien&#39;s house, just west of the <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Grand_Exchange\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Grand Exchange</a>, quickest using fairy ring <b>D</b><b>K</b><b>R</b>. Use the engrammeter inside."
            ],
            [
              "<a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Zemouregal\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Zemouregal</a>",
              "This next section will take you into the <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Wilderness\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Wilderness</a>. <br>Make sure you have a summoned <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Macaw\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">macaw</a> and are wearing <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Insulated_boots\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">insulated boots</a>. Go to <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Hartwin\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Hartwin</a> in <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Varrock_Palace\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Varrock Palace</a>, on the 2<sup>nd</sup> floor (UK) / 3<sup>rd</sup> floor (US) of the north-west tower. Ask him to lead you to the <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Chaos_Temple_(Wilderness)\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Chaos Temple</a>.<br>• Go down the trapdoor, and follow the corridors full of armoured zombies.<br>• <i>Ignore</i> the human detector corridor; squeeze through the pipe in the next room. Follow the passage around to another pipe.<br>• Try to go through it. Then right-click on the summoned macaw and remote view.<br>• Go into the south room in the corridor, use the engrammeter."
            ],
            [
              "<a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Sliske\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Sliske</a>",
              "In the throne room (octagon-shaped room) of the <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Empyrean_Citadel\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Empyrean Citadel</a>. Use the <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Invitation_box\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">invitation box</a> to teleport there quickly."
            ],
            [
              "<a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Mizzarch\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Mizzarch</a>",
              "Go to the <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Varrock_Dig_Site\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Varrock Dig Site</a>. Go down into the <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Senntisten_Temple\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Senntisten Temple</a> (north-east winch). Use the engrammeter in the altar room."
            ],
            [
              "<a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Jhallan\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Jhallan</a>",
              "Go to the <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Erjolf%27s_cave\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Erjolf&#39;s cave</a> (east of <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Olaf_Hradson\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Olaf Hradson</a>, above the entrance to Keldagrim). Cross the river and enter the cave opening to the west. Use the engrammeter near the floating bridge to the centre island. Fairy code <b>D</b><b>K</b><b>S</b> will place you just a few steps from the cave."
            ],
            [
              "<a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Palkeera\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Palkeera</a>",
              "Go to the <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Mahjarrat_Ritual_Site\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Mahjarrat Ritual Site</a>. Use the engrammeter next to the <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Ritual_marker\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">ritual marker</a>."
            ],
            [
              "<a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Lamistard\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Lamistard</a>",
              "Go to <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Zemouregal%27s_fort\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Zemouregal&#39;s fort</a>, west of the <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Mahjarrat_Ritual_Site\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Mahjarrat Ritual Site</a>. Go inside using the left side of the large front door. Use the engrammeter."
            ],
            [
              "<a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Ralvash\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Ralvash</a>",
              "Go to <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Ghorrock\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Ghorrock</a>. Go into the fortress courtyard, and use the engrammeter."
            ],
            [
              "<a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Kharshai\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Kharshai</a>",
              "Go to Kharshai&#39;s cave, where you begin the miniquest. Use the engrammeter inside. (Skip this if you already completed this earlier.)"
            ]
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "step",
          "id": "finding-the-memories:gl1cbd",
          "html": "Take the final memory to Kharshai, receive your reward.",
          "text": "Take the final memory to Kharshai, receive your reward.",
          "dialogue": [],
          "images": [],
          "tables": [],
          "substeps": []
        },
